<h1 align="start" nodeId="924066b3261d4f77811ad2ba24b26f4a">三、操作指南</h1>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="244eb83e510f463b80d8b7c3bf1fe68e">1、web页面：单条、批量查询</h3>
<ul nodeId="e39fca3d7d47461e86623b9b725a89f7">
<li nodeId="be9c143ff55b49d7903da0ea489d28cb">
<p align="start" nodeId="97155f665d7c4c63acaedfd458d25d16"><strong>近线画布线上执行查询</strong></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="d417043369f447bdb3e45630a31a9363">可通过日志查询-近线任务日志查询线上画布执行明细数据。<span color="">当前默认发送日志条件：“命中任意一条规则 || 命中任意一个决策组件 || 命中任意一个旁路输出组件”；除此之外还支持自定义条件，需要提tt工单找研发后台配置</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="fd1e3e7509354fa193fe38a4421daafc">
<p align="start" nodeId="8ceb630297c74a6bb868be643a18329a"><strong>自定义查询字段</strong></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="0699ecb3185a44db923c9ac56cbf4099">在日志配置中自定义配置查询条件<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/62096766" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/62096766" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="2e35df2753b1401cb642440265f9cdd9">https://km.sankuai.com/page/62096766</a></p>
</li>
</ul>
<ul nodeId="e32e6f1e8f804098be3e401db229b85d">
<li nodeId="f9354c63b13540d581ce24a40c7a1580">
<p align="start" nodeId="54f04964860a4635b7470548269f971f"><strong>明细数据单条查询</strong></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="c53e51b7c96e4cba8872c52eceb30fa8">可通过指定条件查询近15天的明细数据</p>
</li>
<li nodeId="42e92d047a7d459baa3caf2e19ee94ce">
<p align="start" nodeId="7611c9ac8ac7422db82063e80814098e"><strong>明细数据批量查询</strong></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="50b4592f712549248ece02834cfc1f3a">可通过指定画布、命中规则等条件查询近15天分箱数据（group by）,例如：指定画布按命中规则、生效规则group by</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p align="start" nodeId="13a633167acb4becb675269f213ef094"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357527347/4215086746?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1050.12" height="600" nodeId="3e690768b0784528b0aadb6b6dd2f5b4" /></p>
